# Documentation Images

Screenshots for Synaplan documentation.

| Image | Used In |
|-------|---------|
| synaplan-tour.webp | README.md (animated hero) |
| tour/*.webp | README.md (tour grid, click-to-enlarge) |
| tour/thumbs/*.webp | README.md (tour grid thumbnails) |
| tour/chat.webp | FEATURES.md |
| tour/rag-search.webp | RAG.md |
| tour/chat-widget.webp | WIDGET.md |
| tour/provider-setup.webp | CONFIGURATION.md |

Every image here is generated — run `scripts/build-readme-tour.sh` to rebuild
them from the raw captures in `tour/src/` (gitignored). Do not edit the
generated files by hand; recapture the source PNG and rerun the script, so the
docs and the README hero never drift apart.

Recommended size for new hand-added screenshots: 1200px width, PNG or WebP.
